---
layout: base.njk
title: okuduklarım · read
schemaKind: collection
schemaItems: books
description: "Books Abdullah Öğük is reading and has read. Okuduğum ve okumakta olduğum kitaplar."
---
<header class="page-head">
  <h1>okuduklarım<span class="en" lang="en">read</span></h1>
  <p class="muted">{{ reading.read.length | roundDown }}+ kitap, okuduğum yıla göre. Rafın tamamı <a href="{{ reading.profile }}" rel="me noopener">goodreads</a>'te.<span class="en" lang="en">Books by the year I finished them.</span></p>
</header>

{%- macro book(b) -%}
<li>
  {% if b.url %}<a href="{{ b.url }}" rel="noopener">{{ b.title }}</a>{% else %}<span>{{ b.title }}</span>{% endif %}
  {%- if b.rating %} <span class="rating" aria-label="{{ b.rating }} / 5">{{ b.rating | stars }}</span>{% endif %}
  {%- if b.author %}<span class="sub">{{ b.author }}</span>{% endif %}
  {%- if b.note %}<span class="sub">{{ b.note }}</span>{% endif %}
</li>
{%- endmacro -%}

{%- if reading.reading.length %}
<section class="block">
  <h2 class="label">okuyorum<span class="en" lang="en">reading now</span></h2>
  <ul class="rows">
    {%- for b in reading.reading %}{{ book(b) }}{% endfor %}
  </ul>
</section>
{%- endif %}

{%- for g in reading.byYear %}
<section class="block">
  <h2 class="label">{% if g.year == "—" %}tarihsiz<span class="en" lang="en">undated</span>{% else %}{{ g.year }}{% endif %}</h2>
  <ul class="rows">
    {%- for b in g.books %}{{ book(b) }}{% endfor %}
  </ul>
</section>
{%- endfor %}
